{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01192","headline":"相和歌辞 从军行 二 · 僧皎然","name":"相和歌辞 从军行 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉斾拂丹霄，汉军新破辽。\n红尘驱卤簿，白羽拥嫖姚。\n战苦军犹乐，功高将不骄。\n至今丁令塞，朔吹空萧萧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"僧皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01192.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01192","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}